#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:61
msgid "**关键问题**：CNN 如何用 **1/4 的参数**达到更好的效果？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:63
msgid "答案就在那两个洞察里："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:65
msgid "**局部感受野**：$3 \\times 3$ 卷积核只看相邻 9 个像素，而非全部 784 个"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:66
msgid "**权值共享**：同一个卷积核滑过整张图像，参数重复使用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:69
msgid "感受野"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:71
msgid ""
"**感受野（Receptive Field）** 是理解 CNN "
"最重要的概念之一。它定义为**输出特征图上的一个神经元对应到输入图像上的区域大小**。简单说：一个神经元\"看到\"了输入图像上多大一个区域。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:73
msgid "第1层卷积：$3 \\times 3$ 卷积核，感受野 = $3 \\times 3$（只看相邻像素）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:74
msgid "第2层卷积：堆叠两个 $3 \\times 3$，感受野 = $5 \\times 5$（看到更广的区域）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:75
msgid "第3层卷积：堆叠三个 $3 \\times 3$，感受野 = $7 \\times 7$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:77
msgid "**递推公式**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:79
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"RF_l = RF_{l-1} + (K_l - 1) \\times \\prod_{i=1}^{l-1} s_i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:83
msgid "其中 $RF_l$ 是第 $l$ 层的感受野大小，$K_l$ 是卷积核大小，$s_i$ 是第 $i$ 层的步长。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:85
msgid "感受野随着网络深度线性增长。这也是为什么需要深层网络——**层数越多，每个神经元能捕获的上下文信息越丰富**。注意，感受野完全由网络架构（卷积核大小、步长、层数）决定，训练不会改变它。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:87
msgid "卷积操作的基本原理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"卷积操作是CNN的核心，它通过滑动窗口的方式在输入图像上应用（通过点积）滤波器（卷积核）来提取特征。这种思想最早由LeCun等人在1989年提出 "
"{cite}`lecun1989backpropagation`，并在后续的LeNet-5工作中 "
"{cite}`lecun1998gradient` 得到完善。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:95
msgid "卷积操作示意图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:99
msgid "**卷积操作的数学定义**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:101
msgid "数学上严格定义的卷积包含核的翻转："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"(f * g)[m,n] = \\sum_{i=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sum_{j=-\\infty}^{\\infty} "
"f[i,j] \\cdot g[m-i, n-j]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:107
msgid "但在深度学习中，我们实际使用的是**互相关（cross-correlation）**，省略了翻转步骤："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:109
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Y[i,j] = \\sum_{u=0}^{k-1}\\sum_{v=0}^{k-1} X[i+u, j+v] \\cdot K[u,v] + b"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:113
msgid "由于卷积核的数值是通过训练学习的，翻转与否对结果没有影响——网络会自动学到合适的核值。因此，本文后续提到的\"卷积\"均指互相关形式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:115
msgid "其中："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:116
msgid "$X$：输入特征图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:117
msgid "$K$：卷积核（滤波器）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:118
msgid "$b$：偏置项"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:119
msgid "$k$：卷积核大小"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:122
msgid "直觉：卷积核为什么能提取特征？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:124
msgid "卷积核提取特征的原理其实很直观：**点积 = 相似度度量**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:126
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"回想一下两个向量的点积：$\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b} = \\sum_i a_i "
"b_i$。当两个向量方向一致时，点积最大；方向相反时，点积为负。换句话说，**点积衡量了两个向量的相似程度**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:128
msgid "卷积操作就是反复做点积："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:131
msgid "卷积核=模式匹配器"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:178
msgid "这个 3×3 的卷积核左边全是 -1、中间是 0、右边全是 1——它检测的是**垂直边缘**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:180
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"当图像局部区域的**左边暗、右边亮**（如 $\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 0 & "
"1\\end{bmatrix}$），点积结果是**正数**（上图结果是 3），说明\"这里有垂直边缘\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:181
msgid "如果图像区域是均匀的（如全是 0），点积结果是 0，说明\"这里没有边缘\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:182
msgid "如果左边亮右边暗，点积结果是负数，说明\"这里有反方向的边缘\""
msgstr ""

