msgid ""
"训练过程中，卷积核的数值通过反向传播自动调整——**网络自己\"学会\"了要检测什么特征**。浅层学边缘、深层学语义，这就是 {ref"
"}`inductive-bias` 中讨论的层次特征提取。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:195
msgid ""
"简单来说，卷积操作就是**拿着一个个\"模板\"（卷积核）在图像上滑动，在每个位置计算模板和该区域的相似度**。相似的区域得到高响应，不相似的得到低响应。32"
" 个卷积核就是 32 个不同的模板，各自关注不同的模式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:198
msgid "特征图尺寸计算"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:200
msgid "对于输入尺寸为 $W \\times H$，卷积核大小为 $K \\times K$，步长为 $S$，填充为 $P$ 的情况，输出特征图的尺寸为："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:202
#, python-brace-format
msgid "W_{out} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{W - K + 2P}{S} \\right\\rfloor + 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:206
#, python-brace-format
msgid "H_{out} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{H - K + 2P}{S} \\right\\rfloor + 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:210
msgid "MNIST实例计算"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:213
msgid "对于28×28的MNIST图像，使用3×3卷积核，步长S=1，填充P=1："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:214
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"输出宽度：$W_{out} = \\lfloor \\frac{28 - 3 + 2 \\times 1}{1} \\rfloor + 1 = "
"28$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:215
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"输出高度：$H_{out} = \\lfloor \\frac{28 - 3 + 2 \\times 1}{1} \\rfloor + 1 = "
"28$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:216
msgid "结论：输出特征图尺寸保持28×28不变"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:218
msgid "如果使用2×2池化，步长S=2，无填充P=0："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:219
#, python-brace-format
msgid "输出尺寸：$W_{out} = \\lfloor \\frac{28 - 2 + 0}{2} \\rfloor + 1 = 14$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:220
msgid "结论：池化将特征图尺寸减半"
