#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:224
msgid "参数共享机制"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:226
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`洞察二 <cnn-basics>` 中我们建立了权值共享的直觉：同一个检测规则在所有位置反复使用。下面用数学语言精确描述这一机制。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:228
msgid "卷积层的一个重要特性是参数共享。同一个卷积核在图像的不同位置重复使用，这大大减少了参数数量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:234
msgid "参数共享机制示意图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:237
msgid "对于 $C_{\\text{out}}$ 个输出通道，每个通道使用独立的卷积核："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:239
msgid ""
"\\text{Parameters} = C_{\\text{out}} \\times (K \\times K \\times C_{in} "
"+ 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:243
#, python-brace-format
msgid "其中 $C_{in}$ 是输入通道数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:245
msgid "以MNIST为例（单通道输入，32个3×3卷积核）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:247
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{Parameters} = 32 \\times (3 \\times 3 \\times 1 + 1) = 32 \\times "
"10 = 320"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:251
msgid "相比全连接层的数万参数，卷积层的参数数量显著减少了99%以上。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:254
msgid "卷积层的优势"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:256
msgid "回到找猫和十字路口的例子：局部连接让你每次聚焦一个小区域（洞察一），权值共享让你用同一个检测器扫遍全图（洞察二），平移不变性正是两者的自然推论。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:258
msgid "卷积层的核心优势"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:261
msgid "**局部连接**：每个神经元只连接输入图像的局部区域"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:262
msgid "**权值共享**：同一卷积核在整个图像上滑动，大幅减少参数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:263
msgid "**平移不变性**：相同特征在不同位置被同一卷积核检测"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:264
msgid "**层次特征提取**：浅层提取边缘等低级特征，深层提取语义等高级特征"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:268
msgid "池化层"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:270
msgid "直觉理解"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:272
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`receptive-"
"field`告诉我们，卷积层通过堆叠来逐步扩大感受野。但有一个问题：如果只用卷积堆叠，特征图的空间尺寸始终不变（比如28×28），后面的全连接层要处理的参数量会非常庞大。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:274
msgid "**我们需要一种\"压缩\"机制**——在保留关键特征的同时，减小空间尺寸。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:276
msgid "池化层就是CNN的\"压缩包\"："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:278
msgid "**最大池化（Max Pooling）**：保留最显著的特征，丢弃细节。就像做摘要：只记最重要的论点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:279
msgid "**平均池化（Average Pooling）**：保留整体信息，平滑噪声。就像取平均成绩，反映整体水平"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:281
msgid "图解：池化怎么压缩特征图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:284
msgid "2×2池化操作示意"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:335
msgid "**Max Pooling**：每个2×2窗口只保留最大值——这代表该区域最强的特征响应。原来4×4=16个数字，压缩后只剩4个。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:337
msgid "**Avg Pooling**：每个2×2窗口取平均值——保留了该区域的整体信息强度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:339
msgid "为什么Max Pooling更常用？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:341
#, python-brace-format
msgid "在实际CNN中，**Max Pooling**远比Avg Pooling常用，原因与{ref}`inductive-bias`有关："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:343
msgid "卷积层学出的特征响应本身就是\"这个位置有没有检测到某个模式\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:344
msgid "Max Pooling保留的是**最强的检测信号**，丢弃了\"这个模式在这个区域不是最强位置\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:345
msgid "这个过程本质上是一种**软性平移不变性**：只要特征出现在窗口内某个位置，Max Pooling就能捕获它"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:347
msgid "Max Pooling的直觉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:350
msgid ""
"想象你在一张照片里找猫。Max "
"Pooling的操作是：把照片分成2×2的小格子，每个格子里只保留**最像猫的证据**（最高响应），丢掉其他像素。这样无论猫出现在格子的哪个位置，你都能找到它——这就是**平移不变性**的直觉来源。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:353
msgid "数学定义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:355
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"对于输入特征图 $X \\in \\mathbb{R}^{C \\times H \\times "
"W}$，池化操作在每个通道上独立进行，不改变通道数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:357
msgid "**最大池化**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:359
msgid ""
"\n"
"Y[c, i, j] = \\max_{(m,n) \\in \\mathcal{R}_{ij}} X[c, m, n]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:363
msgid "**平均池化**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:365
msgid ""
"\n"
"Y[c, i, j] = \\frac{1}{|\\mathcal{R}_{ij}|} \\sum_{(m,n) \\in "
"\\mathcal{R}_{ij}} X[c, m, n]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:369
#, python-brace-format
msgid "其中 $\\mathcal{R}_{ij}$ 是输出位置$(i,j)$对应的输入区域（如2×2窗口）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:371
msgid "池化与卷积的关键区别"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:374
msgid "池化操作**没有可学习参数**，它的计算是固定的（取最大值或平均值）。这意味着："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:375
msgid "池化不会增加模型的表达能力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:376
msgid "但池化能有效减少计算量（空间尺寸减半 = 计算量减半）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:377
msgid "池化层在反向传播时，梯度直接通过最大值位置回传，无需更新权重"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:380
msgid "池化层尺寸计算"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:382
msgid "池化层的尺寸计算公式与卷积层一致："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:384
msgid ""
"\n"
"W_{\\text{out}} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{W_{\\text{in}} - K + 2P}{S} "
"\\right\\rfloor + 1\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:388
msgid "其中 $K$ 是池化窗口大小，$S$ 是步长，$P$ 是填充。最常用配置是 $K=2, S=2, P=0$，此时输出尺寸恰好减半："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:390
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"28 \\xrightarrow{2\\times2} 14 \\xrightarrow{2\\times2} 7 "
"\\xrightarrow{2\\times2} 4 \\quad \\text{（不足窗口大小时，按floor处理）}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:394
msgid "PyTorch实现"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:396
msgid ""
"import torch.nn as nn\n"
"\n"
"# 最常用：2×2最大池化，步长=2\n"
"# 每次调用，空间尺寸减半，通道数不变\n"
"pool = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2, stride=2)\n"
"\n"
"# 输入：batch_size × channels × height × width\n"
"x = torch.randn(1, 32, 28, 28)  # 32通道，28×28\n"
"y = pool(x)\n"
"print(y.shape)  # torch.Size([1, 32, 14, 14]) —— 32通道不变，空间减半\n"
"\n"
"# 平均池化\n"
"avg_pool = nn.AvgPool2d(kernel_size=2, stride=2)\n"
"\n"
"# 自适应池化：输入可变，输出固定尺寸\n"
"# 这在 ResNet 中用于替代全连接层，称为全局平均池化（GAP）\n"
"# 见本文后续\"池化选型指南\"表格中的说明\n"
"adaptive_pool = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d((1, 1))\n"
msgstr ""

