#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:442
msgid "Max Pooling 反向传播示意"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-basics.md:488
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这个机制在后面讨论{ref}`gradient-vanishing`时会再次出现——Max "
"Pooling的梯度\"门控\"特性，某种程度上帮助缓解了梯度在深层网络中的稀释问题。"
